  "result": "Excellent! All 286 tests pass. Here's what I've added:\n\n## Late Fee Calculation\n\nAdded `lateFee(invoice, asOf)` function to `src/reports.js` that:\n\n- Calculates the number of days overdue using `daysBetween(invoice.dueDate, asOf)`\n- Returns `0` if the invoice is not overdue (daysOverdue \u2264 0)\n- Otherwise calculates: `balanceDue * daysOverdue * 0.0004` (0.04% per day)\n- Returns the fee rounded to the nearest cent\n\nAdded 17 comprehensive tests covering:\n- Not overdue and future due dates\n- 0.04% per day calculation\n- Discounted invoices and multiple lines\n- Partial and zero payments\n- Vouchers\n- VAT-exempt items and multiple VAT rates\n- Rounding behavior\n- Large amounts and long overdue periods\n\nThe function correctly factors in all invoice complexities (discounts, VAT, payments, vouchers) when calculating the amount due on which the fee is applied.",
